# The theme's bundles are LF-only. Git for Windows defaults to core.autocrlf=true,
# which turns a fresh clone into CRLF — the committed bundles would then differ
# from the bytes the test suite runs against and from the kernel the generated
# contour worker is embedded from. Upstream 1.1.5 shipped no .gitattributes;
# this fork adds one and disables every EOL conversion.
* -text
